# #5837, the staleHigh exclusion (b6c84690; a5e2e2ef's ruling with F2'): L's staleHigh
# excludes only its donor's forwards tagged with the split that created L.
MODULE: StaleHighExcludesReceiverTagCountsReceiverTag
TARGET: StaleHighExcludesReceiverTag
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: L's staleHigh counts its donor's forwards into L itself, so every receiver that took a pre-link forward needs a replay past its own applied writes
PERTURBS: ForwardIntoL
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithForwardIn = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ sHi' = IF StaleHighCountsTag("L") THEN next ELSE sHi
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the receiver's own tag is not excluded.
    /\ sHi' = next
--- END
